Project: College Management System
Stack: MERN (MongoDB, Express, React, Node.js)

Portals & Features:

Student: View marks (internal/external), download materials, view notices/timetables, update password

Faculty: View student info, upload materials, manage timetables, post notices, record marks, update password

Admin: Manage accounts (add/edit), manage subjects & notices

Tech:

Frontend: React, Redux, TailwindCSS

Backend: Node.js, Express

Database: MongoDB

Setup:

Clone repo

Install dependencies in frontend & backend

Create .env files from .env.sample

Run npm run seed (Admin Login: 123456 / admin123)

Start servers with npm start
